WEBVTT

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:09.980
How frustrating.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.700
That Rokudou...

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:17.610
Last week, I invited Mamiya-san 
to our nostalgic Haunted Cedar.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.080
From there, we were 
supposed to go to the movies,

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:27.140
eat dinner, maybe play at the arcade, 
and make plans for our next date!

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.530
"Isn't this fun, Mamiya-san?!"

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.640
"Yeah, Tsubasa-kun!"

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.020
"Isn't this fun, Mamiya-san?!"

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.000
"Yeah, Tsubasa-kun!"

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.660
"Isn't this fun, Mamiya-san?!"

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:34.760
"Yeah, Tsubasa-kun!"

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:44.040
Before I knew it, Rokudou somehow got 
involved and interrupted my purification.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:50.950
Even at the meal afterwards, he sat 
right in between me and Mamiya-san!

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:56.030
And I somehow ended up paying for all of it.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:59.900
Rokudou always takes the good moments!

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.670
Not to mention, the power stone I managed to 
get back is still tainted by an evil spirit.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:12.490
If I leave it tainted, not only will 
I not be able to purify things,

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:14.810
it'll attract bad things.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.680
That's a nice stone you've got there.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.100
Who are you?

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.810
You're not human.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.700
I'm Masato,

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.070
a demon.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:06.990
Curse of the Power Stone

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.990
A demon...

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:07.750
Ow, ow, ow!

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.750
Why did you hit me?

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.780
"Why" nothing!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.310
Take this! Holy Ash!

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:25.010
The only things you could exorcise with 
that ash are possibly low-level spirits.

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:30.310
You seem to be much more 
mature than Rinne-kun.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.240
What?

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:34.360
You know Rokudou?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.600
Not only do I know him, 
I thoroughly despise him.

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:41.030
Rinne-kun's existence is 
nothing but a nuisance.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:42.800
You feel the same.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.120
What? What are you talking about?

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:50.750
That tainted power stone... it can 
currently curse someone, if you want.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.920
That is the Demon's Tome.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:04.470
It magnifies the user's hatred, 
and manifests itself into a curse.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.470
You just need to put your hand upon 
it and make a wish on the stone,

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.810
and Rinne-kun will be cursed.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.460
Just as you wish.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.070
Don't mess with me, demon!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:21.030
I haven't sunk so low that 
I'd actually curse someone!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.370
I told you, Holy Ash has no effect on me.

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:30.960
I'm willing to make a wager

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:33.500
that you will, without a 
doubt, curse Rinne-kun!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.240
Without a doubt!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:49.150
Jumonji-kun was talking to himself.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:49.930
Yeah.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.200
What a silly guy.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.200
<i>Masato, who is a demon, cannot 
be seen by normal humans.</i>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.360
R-Rinne-sama, that's...

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.000
King of Peaches
Made in Japan

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.000
A luxury item we've only dreamed about!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.820
Canned peaches!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.570
It was an offering in the weather box,

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.620
and I was holding on to it...

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:15.350
But I think I'm going to give 
it to Mamiya Sakura as a gift.

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:17.190
What?! Why?

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:19.710
Sincerity.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.090
Sincerity?

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:26.460
Mamiya Sakura's done a lot for me lately.

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:28.450
I don't think it's just lately.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.810
Not to mention, I owe her money.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:36.530
True. Starting with the 500 yen you 
borrowed from her for the Fire Cart,

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.360
I wonder how much you owe now...

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:45.610
Oh, so would this be in place of interest?

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.610
Sincerity!

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:51.890
You can call it whatever you want,

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:56.620
but with those tears of blood you're 
crying, it's a bit heavy, Rinne-sama.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.770
Oh, there he is.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:06.130
Tsubasa-kun!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.130
Mamiya-san.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.500
What is it?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.210
Well... If you'd like some,

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:14.060
I have some homemade cookies for you

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.940
For me?!

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.430
There were a few too many.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.600
My mom's really into baking sweets lately.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.190
Homemade cookies that Mamiya-san made!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:30.310
<i>Mamiya Sakura's explanation had 
not made it to Jumonji's ears.</i>

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.000
<i>My heart is being cleansed.</i>

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:37.450
<i>It feels like talking to that 
demon never even happened.</i>

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.080
Hup.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.270
Oy.

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:46.510
I thought I'd give these to Rokudou-kun.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.110
Ah...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:50.830
Mamiya Sakura!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.340
Hm?

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.480
There's something I want to give you!

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:57.980
I see that your conviction 
is rock-solid, Rinne-sama.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:01.730
<i>Rokudou! Speak of the devil...</i>

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.480
Oh, yeah.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.440
Here, Tsubasa-kun.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.400
The Demon's Tome?!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.840
This is Jumonji's notebook.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.330
Suzuki-sensei gave it to me to give to you.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.040
He said you should take better 
care of your notebooks.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.630
The can!

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:37.930
<i>You just need to put your hand upon 
it and make a wish on the stone.</i>

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:43.770
<i>Did I just curse Rokudou?</i>

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.400
Are you okay, Rokudou-kun?

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:55.030
<i>God might be punishing me for 
trying to give more than I have...</i>

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.010
Tsubasa-kun?

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:02.330
Oh?

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:05.370
<i>This is...</i>

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:13.000
There's no doubt about it: the 
taint in the power stone has grown.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:18.570
To think that an exorcist like me would 
give in to a demon and curse someone...

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:19.970
What a disgrace!

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.010
Er, I'm sorry about this...

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:27.610
I somehow ended up receiving this large 
amount of premium sweets instead.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.000
It's fine.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.110
And then...

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:35.300
Rokudou takes advantage of being 
poor to be closer to Mamiya-san!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.560
Damn it!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.230
Sakura-sama told me to deliver that to you.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:45.680
So I did.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.420
I-It's getting blacker!

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.650
Did another curse take place?

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:16.240
It's futile.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.800
No matter how many times you try 
to get rid of the Demon's Tome,

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.980
it'll find its way back to you.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:25.570
Where are the cookies?!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.090
Is this really the wrath of God?

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:35.510
Er... Doesn't it seem some 
unnatural power is at work here?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.850
Morning, Rokudou-kun.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.780
Ah, Sakura-sama.

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.190
Mamiya Sakura.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.010
You got a present in the weather box?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:52.610
Yeah...

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:57.640
There wasn't a request included, 
just this taiyaki, a locket,

00:09:58.310 --> 00:09:59.740
which has a mirror inside,

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:03.130
and a memo saying that
I need to keep it near me.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.780
Maybe they're your fan?

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:09.480
No, this present is without 
a doubt a talisman.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:10.250
Which means

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.380
the person who left it

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.890
is someone that knows that unnatural 
calamities have been happening

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.400
to me since yesterday.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:22.790
<i>Because of that Demon Masato, 
despite it being coincidence,</i>

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.890
<i>I've ended up cursing Rokudou.</i>

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.890
<i>Even though I've gotten 
rid of the Demon's Tome,</i>

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:31.250
<i>Masato is still after Rokudou.</i>

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:34.790
<i>That locket I left in the weather box</i>

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:38.390
<i>is a talisman that's been 
in my family for years.</i>

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:42.930
<i>The mirror inside deflects any curse.</i>

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:50.250
<i>Rokudou, that should protect you.</i>

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.050
<i>I'm such a softie.</i>

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.550
I wonder who gave it to you.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:01.180
Wait. Why does Mamiya-san have the locket?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.930
More importantly, did they just 
come into the classroom together?

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:06.810
Was that coincidence?

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:13.690
Or did they meet up somewhere?
Is Mamiya-san that worried about Rokudou?

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:17.350
<i>I sent that locket out of kindness,</i>

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:20.950
<i>yet they're talking so closely about it.</i>

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.340
Morning, Rika-chan.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:23.620
Morning.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.280
Ah, Jumonji-kun.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.760
This is yours, isn't it?

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:33.350
<i>To think that I was concerned 
for Rokudou even for a moment...</i>

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:34.710
<i>I was a fool!</i>

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.220
Whoa, it started pouring out of nowhere.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.230
Eh?

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:43.590
A leak?!

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.850
<i>Th-The taiyaki...</i>

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.360
<i>The Demon's Tome?!</i>

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.350
<i>But I threw it away!</i>

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:05.120
There's no doubt about it.
I've been cursed.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:08.080
But who would... Tsubasa-kun!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:13.950
Isn't there anything you can do?
You're an exorcist.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.540
<i>W-Well...</i>

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.550
<i>Mamiya-san,</i>

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.510
<i>if you would just give the 
locket in your hand to Rokudou,</i>

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.800
<i>that would solve everything...</i>

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:30.180
I don't know who's doing this, but 
people who curse others are awful.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:35.440
Maybe they have their reasons...

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:38.060
Probably. But they're still awful.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.940
C-Crap...

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:44.620
<i>If she finds out that I'm 
the one cursing Rokudou,</i>

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:47.120
<i>Mamiya-san will hate me.</i>

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:52.330
<i>It's Rokudou's fault that 
she'll hate me! Damn it!</i>

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.000
A washbasin?!

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.730
Never fear, Mamiya-san.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.960
I'll track down the culprit.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:04.330
Really, Tsubasa-kun?

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:05.160
Yeah.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:06.790
Bye!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.320
<i>First, I've got to dispose 
of this Demon's Tome!</i>

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.530
<i>If I burn it...</i>

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:28.010
<i>The curse shouldn't occur 
without the Demon's Tome.</i>

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:34.040
<i>And then... I'll defeat Masato myself. 
If that happens, it'll all be over.</i>

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.550
Ow...

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:48.800
This is Jumonji's book...

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.460
Are you heading home early, too, Rokudou-kun?

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.660
Yeah. Something is bothering me.

00:13:56.090 --> 00:14:00.370
<i>I didn't notice it yesterday, but there 
seems to be a black aura coming from Jumonji.</i>

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:05.820
<i>It's not from a living thing, 
rather something he's got with him.</i>

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.370
It's almost completely black.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:14.330
So the more I curse him, the blacker it gets.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:19.460
But I'm going to take 
advantage of this dark aura.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.800
I don't know what you're going to try,

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.760
but you cannot escape 
the chain of negativity!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:33.720
The blackness of the power stone 
is the taint in your soul.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.770
Once the stone's curse disposes of Rinne-kun,

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:41.480
the holy stone will turn to black, 
leaving not even a speck of light.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:46.910
And at the same time, I shall 
have your tainted soul, Jumonji.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:49.610
I will bring you down to Hell.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:56.870
So you were behind this, Masato.

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.370
Wh-What might you be talking about?

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.730
So you're the one who made

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.050
the canned peaches, cookies, 
and taiyaki all inedible.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:12.140
That's some accusation. 
Jumonji was behind all of that...

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:16.310
Hey, listen to...

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:23.320
All right. Preparations for 
demon summoning are complete.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:25.690
And now...

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:30.510
I make a wish upon this tainted power stone.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:34.950
Stone, summon Demon Masato 
within the magic circle.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:37.950
Masato.

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:41.830
The moment you enter the magic 
circle, it will be your last.

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.810
Tsubasa-kun!

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:46.540
Mamiya-san?!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:51.300
<i>What?! That can't be...</i>

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.450
Tsubasa-kun, here.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:57.430
It came falling from nowhere.

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:03.370
<i>Th-The Demon's Tome... but I burned it...</i>

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.700
<i>Wh-Why is Rokudou with him?!</i>

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.700
Damn it! You're in the way, Rokudou!

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.210
Well done, Jumonji.

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:23.370
What?!

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:27.790
Because of your curses, 
I was able to defeat Rinne-kun.

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.450
Tsubasa-kun?

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:32.520
<i>C-Crap...</i>

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:35.760
You were the one cursing Rokudou-kun?

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:40.150
The cat's out of the bag, Jumonji.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.390
Rinne-sama!

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.220
Don't worry.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:50.860
One more curse and that nuisance, 
Rinne-kun, will be finished.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.640
<i>One more?!</i>

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:58.870
<i>If Rokudou would just disappear, my 
relationship with Mamiya-san would be...</i>

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.500
Tsubasa-kun would never 
do something so awful!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.150
<i>D-Doh!</i>

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.000
<i>It's over.</i>

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:12.360
<i>The next time I curse Rokudou, 
Mamiya-san will hate me forever.</i>

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.750
<i>I-I can't...</i>

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.510
Are you okay, Rokudou-kun?

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.770
Look how snuggled up they are. 
They must be very close.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:30.770
<i>I'm damned if I curse, 
and I'm damned if I don't.</i>

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:37.140
This all happened because 
my heart was weak.

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.690
Is Jumonji...

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:42.400
Eh?

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:44.290
Is he going to try to curse himself?

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.850
Don't! It's dangerous!

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:48.930
Tsubasa-kun!

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:53.800
Don't try to stop me, Rokudou. 
I cannot forgive how weak I was.

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:59.800
Power stone, curse me! I should just...

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:05.420
die hitting my head on the corner of tofu!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:07.940
Huh?

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.860
Are you okay, Tsubasa-kun?

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:19.240
Laugh at me, Mamiya-san. 
I got what I deserved...

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:24.530
This is a super soft kinugoshi.

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:27.500
He's always very soft on himself.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:33.750
<i>Rinne and Rokumon made sure to eat 
this tofu deliciously later on.</i>

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:37.520
Huh? Tsubasa-kun, the power stone...

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.260
The taint went down to half!

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:46.560
I see... the fact that I cursed 
myself purified the power stone.

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.440
Then I just need to keep punishing myself!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:53.100
How about sitting on a mat of needles?

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.940
How about strangling yourself with a rope?

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.200
It'll be faster to curse Masato.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.570
What happened to punishing yourself?

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:05.630
Just try it, you B-level exorcist.

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:06.450
What?!

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:13.740
<i>Just try and curse me! The moment you try 
and curse anyone other than yourself,</i>

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:18.460
<i>the stone will turn black again, 
and you'll go straight to Hell!</i>

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:24.280
Demon Masato! Burn in Hell 
with the stone's curse!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.490
Crap! Mamiya Sakura, the locket!

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:29.100
Eh?

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.140
This?

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:35.740
Hot!

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:37.470
Hot!

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.760
The curse deflected?

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.630
Rokudou-kun, why...

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:52.500
My, my, Rinne-kun. 
You're rather black-hearted, as well.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.740
You got revenge, right?

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:58.500
Considering what you went through 
because of Jumonji's curses.

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.260
No...

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.510
I see...

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:12.690
Because the curse deflected, it was 
the same result as cursing myself.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.340
Purification complete!

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.150
Oh, the power stone's purified!

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:21.030
Wh-What?!

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.830
As much as I hate to do it, 
I thank you, Rokudou.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:27.240
If that curse went through, 
I might have gone to Hell.

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:30.250
That was close, Jumonji.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.460
You're okay with that?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.540
This is pretty bad.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:41.510
Now, I will show you the power 
of the purified power stone!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:44.180
You're just bluffing.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:47.260
Come forth, light!

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.070
What the hell are these things?!

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:00.220
Fighting spirit!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.120
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:06.970
That's...

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.950
Sprites from the Holy Stone.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.580
Orly...

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:17.000
Don't think you've won just yet.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:19.860
Hup.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:28.610
We won.

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:30.130
Those sprites are strong.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:34.750
Hit me, Rokudou.

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:35.940
Tsubasa-kun...

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.670
Despite being tricked by a demon,

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.810
there's no denying the 
fact that I cursed you.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:44.110
I'm not worried about it.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:50.600
Actually, I'd rather congratulate 
you on defeating the demon

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:55.480
and gaining a new weapon 
with the power stone.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.400
Rokudou.

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:01.250
You're such a nice guy...

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:08.330
Oh, yeah... I think I'm getting hungry.

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:14.850
<i>And before I knew it,</i>

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:17.780
<i>I ended up treating Rokudou again.</i>

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:22.230
<i>And he's sitting right 
between me and Mamiya-san.</i>

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:24.390
Congrats, Jumonji.

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:30.570
Huh? The power stone seems 
to be darkening again.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
Shirushigami Kain

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:03.030
Hey, Ageha.

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:03.800
What?

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:06.100
Try saying "Shirushigami Kain" ten times.

00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:08.370
Shirushigami Kain. Shirushigami Kain.

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:10.550
Shirushigami Kain. Shirushigami Kain.

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:12.680
Shirushigami Kain. Shirushigami Kai.

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:14.050
Shirushigamin Kain.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:16.380
What's this orange-colored fruit?

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:18.420
Mikain... I mean mikan (tangerine)!

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:20.550
Bzzz! It's an orange.

00:24:20.550 --> 00:24:21.730
You got me!

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:25.980
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
"Shirushigami Kain."
